  "title": "Turnip and Potato Soup",
  "description": "This turnip and potato soup recipe includes kale and bacon for a hearty, one-bowl meal. Thin the soup with broth, water, or cream for the ideal texture.",
  "authors": [
    "Cheri Walker"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-31T00:50:30-04:00",
